&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE linkToPontoPrograma DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE linkToPontoPrograma :
/*---------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     Recebe handle do DBO Item e execute mÇtodo getKey
  Parameters:  recebe handle de um DBO
  Notes:       
----------------------------------------------------------------*/
   DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER pHandle AS HANDLE NO-UNDO.
   
   RUN getKey IN pHandle (OUTPUT icod-programa).
   
   RUN setConstraintPontoPrograma IN THIS-PROCEDURE (INPUT icod-programa).
   
   RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

